{"resourceIdentifier":"2326","resourceName":"Guangxi Jinxiu IFM (conversion  of  logged  to  protected  forest)  Project","description":"The Guangxi Jinxiu IFM (conversion  of  logged  to  protected  forest)  Project  (hereafter “the project activity”) is implemented in Jinxiu Yao Autonomous County, Laibin City, Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region of China by Jinxiu Forestry and Grassland Bureau, the geo-coordinate of the  project  is  109.840797E—110.440241E and 23.724686N-24.443053N,  the total area is 18,333.3 ha, which includes  the  Improved  Forest  Management  (IFM)  of  the forests in the conversion of logged to protected forest.\r\nThe area of the project activity is 6,572 ha, including 249 subcompartments spreading over Jinxiu Forest Farm, Jinxiu Town, Toupai Town, Dazhang Township, Liuxiang Township, Luoxiang Township, Sanjiang Township, Sanjiao Township, Changdong Township, Zhongliang Township of Jinxiu Yao Autonomous County. All these forests are state-owned forests or privately-owned or collective-owned, and have the legal right to forest ownership. The species involved in the project are Broad-leaved tree, Chinese fir and Pinus massoniana.\r\nBefore the implementation of the project activity, the trees are logged based on a valid and verifiable government-approved timber management plan for harvesting the project area. The implementation of the project activity converses the trees to protected forest to reduce the GHG emissions for about 1,832,004 tCO2e in 20 years, the average annual emission reduction is 91,600  tCO2e and Verified Carbon Units with buffer deduction is about 1,690,014  tCO2e in 20 years, and average annual VCUs with buffer deduction is 84,500  tCO2e.\r\nThe project activity will contribute to the environment (biodiversity conservation, rocky desertification prevention and soil erosion control), thus contribute to sustainable development.","location":{"latitude":23.724686,"longitude":109.840797},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-09-08","endExclusive":"2020-10-09","endInclusive":"2020-10-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2326"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jinxiu Yao Autonomous County Zhengtong Asset Management Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region of China, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"On Hold - see notification letter"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2326"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2326"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"58501"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":70023}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"IFM"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0010"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"6572 Hectares"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"12/07/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/03/2016 - 29/02/2036"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=47676&IDKEY=00e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9a65745204","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"The Guangxi Jinxiu IFM (conversion  of  logged  to  protected  forest)  Project.pdf","uploadDate":"2020-07-29T07:51:13.137Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=47675